# Rechecked 2026-08-05 (Fluent UI + packaging):
# - Track product source: src/ (incl. src/ui/fluent/), tests/, scripts/, requirements.txt,
#   naverland-scrapper.spec, docs/, root product markdown (README, PROJECT_AUDIT, update_history).
# - Ignore generated artifacts: logs/, build/, dist/, data/, caches, Playwright browsers,
#   CodeGraph, agent session dumps.
# - Agent-only docs (CLAUDE.md / claude.md / gemini.md / AGENTS.md 등) stay untracked.
# - Do NOT ignore src/ui/fluent/ or PyQt6-Fluent-Widgets usage notes in product docs.

